  "description": "Add Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool endpoints to any WinUI 3 app. zRover exposes input injection, screenshot capture, coordinate validation, and app-defined action dispatch as MCP tools through an in-process HTTP server — no FullTrust companion process needed. WinUI 3 apps run full-trust, so the MCP server starts directly in-process.\n\nMinimal integration: two lines in App.xaml.cs.",
